  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On an avatar configured with SDK 3.10.6 Native Face Tracking, the local SkinnedMeshRenderer blendshapes for the left eyelid, right eyelid, and left muzzle lock up during normal active use while wearing the headset continuously with eyes moving (as well as after removing and putting the headset back on). Even when raw Unified Expressions tracking values in the VRChat Debug UI read 0.000 and respond normally to live blinks, the 3D mesh remains stuck until a full avatar switch back and forth.\n\nFurther testing, i have found even disabling 'Stream avatar data to VRChat vis OSC in the Vibe hub settings the above scenario still occurs, where the debug UI reads 0, but the face looks the avatar has had a stroke.\n\nHeadset: VIVE Focus Vision",
